WEBVTT

00:05:27.128 --> 00:05:31.182
How very wrong I was.

00:05:31.182 --> 00:05:35.715
In 1987, in the month our eldest son Gerard was born,

00:05:35.715 --> 00:05:38.169
I got my first blind computer,

00:05:38.169 --> 00:05:41.383
and it's actually here.

00:05:41.383 --> 00:05:43.318
See it up there?

00:05:43.318 --> 00:05:47.601
And you see it has no, what do you call it, no screen.

00:05:47.601 --> 00:05:51.919
(Laughter)

00:05:51.919 --> 00:05:53.913
It's a blind computer.

00:05:53.913 --> 00:05:55.813
(Laughter)

00:05:55.813 --> 00:05:58.418
It's a Keynote Gold 84k,

00:05:58.418 --> 00:06:02.594
and the 84k stands for it had 84 kilobytes of memory.